{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Find and grab object if it's near, if not, approach and take it, then process it. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectFound    />\"",
